{
  "retrieved": "2026-10-19",
  "coverage": "21 current provinces and all 326 municipalities from INE census cartography, including Icolo e Bengo, Moxico Leste, Cuando and Cubango. Province polygons are dissolved from the municipality layer to keep hierarchy and outlines consistent. Cabinda is retained as an exclave. Official final 2024 provincial census populations; no invented municipal populations. Source public GIS service attributes INE; no explicit open-data license is supplied. Angola’s complete borders with both Congos and Namibia share the existing adjoining geometry. Inland lake water is excluded.",
  "counts": {
    "1": 21,
    "2": 326
  },
  "processing": "Full available source resolution retained, cleaned together and rounded to six decimal places. Shared internal edges stored once; unselected coasts have no stroke. Deeper geometry loads only for the selected region. All views use the shared regional renderer, selected-outline index, adaptive detail, lifecycle and three-country cache. Territorial waters are excluded from land fills. Territory context features carry their own destination bounds.",
