      "method": "Close enclosed gaps bounded by multiple municipalities, assigning each sliver to its longest adjoining municipality edge, then dissolve the provinces from those repaired municipalities. Preserve single-owner holes and reapply the source lake mask. Coastlines and international frontier arcs are unchanged.",
